     A*==============================================================
     A* TODODSPF - Display file for the To-Do List 5250 application
     A*
     A* Record formats:
     A*   SFRCD  - Subfile record (one todo per row)
     A*   SFCTL  - Subfile control record (rows 1-7 constants ONLY)
     A*   SFFOOT - OVERLAY record for F-key labels (rows 16-17)
     A*   ADDSCR - Add new todo screen
     A*
     A* CPD7812 rule: SFCTL footprint = row-of-first-constant to
     A* row-of-last-constant. That range must NOT include subfile
     A* rows 8-14. All SFCTL constants stay at rows 1-7.
     A* F-key labels below the subfile go in SFFOOT (OVERLAY).
     A*
     A* Indicators:
     A*   01  SFLEND (last page of subfile)
     A*   02  SFLDSP/SFLDSPCTL (subfile has data)
     A*   03  SFLMSG (no records)
     A*   20  Error colour for SFMSG / ADDERR
     A*   71  CF05 Refresh
     A*   72  CF06 Add / CF12 Cancel
     A*   73  CF08 Pending only
     A*   74  CF09 Done only
     A*   75  CF10 All
     A*   98  ROLLUP / ROLLDOWN
     A*   99  CF03 Exit
     A*==============================================================
     A                                      DSPSIZ(24 80 *DS3)
     A                                      INDARA
     A                                      PRINT
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------
     A* SFRCD - Subfile record (one row per todo)
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R SFRCD                     SFL
     A            SFSEL          1A  B  8  3
     A                                      VALUES(' ' '1' '4' '5')
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A            SFTODOID       5Y 0O  8  6EDTCDE(Z)
     A            SFNAME        40A  O  8 13DSPATR(HI)
     A            SFDONE         1A  O  8 55COLOR(GRN)
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------
     A* SFCTL - Subfile control record
     A* Constants ONLY at rows 1-7 (above subfile rows 8-14).
     A* SFMSG field at row 7 col 1 for dynamic messages.
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R SFCTL                     SFLCTL(SFRCD)
     A                                      SFLSIZ(0014)
     A                                      SFLPAG(0007)
     A  01                                  SFLEND(*MORE)
     A N02                                  SFLCLR
     A  02                                  SFLDSP
     A  02                                  SFLDSPCTL
     A  03                                  SFLMSG('No records found.')
     A                                      CF03(99 'Exit')
     A                                      CF05(71 'Refresh')
     A                                      CF06(72 'Add')
     A                                      CF08(73 'Pending')
     A                                      CF09(74 'Done')
     A                                      CF10(75 'All')
     A                                      CF12(99 'Exit')
     A                                      ROLLUP(98)
     A                                      ROLLDOWN(98)
     A                                  1  2'To-Do List'
     A                                  1 30'IBM i To-Do App'
     A                                  1 71DATE
     A                                  3  2'Sel  ID  Task'
     A                                  3 44'Status'
     A                                  3 52'1=Tog 4=Del 5=View'
     A            SFMSG         79A  O  7  1
     A  20                                  DSPATR(HI)
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------
     A* SFFOOT - F-key labels below the subfile (OVERLAY)
     A* Kept separate to avoid CPD7812: SFCTL cannot have constants
     A* spanning rows 1 through 16+ while subfile is at rows 8-14.
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R SFFOOT                    OVERLAY
     A                                 16  2'F3=Exit  F5=Refresh  F6=Add'
     A                                 17  2'F8=Pending  F9=Done  F10=All'
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------
     A* ADDSCR - Add new todo screen
     A*--------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R ADDSCR
     A                                      CF03(99 'Exit')
     A                                      CF12(72 'Cancel')
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                  1  2'Add New To-Do'
     A                                  1 30'IBM i To-Do App'
     A                                  1 71DATE
     A                                  5  5'Task Description:'
     A            ADDNAME       40A  B  5 24DSPATR(HI)
     A                                      CHECK(LC)
     A                                  7  5'Status (Y/N):'
     A            ADDDONE        1A  B  7 20VALUES('Y' 'y' 'N' 'n')
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                 10  5'Enter=Save  F3/F12=Cancel'
     A            ADDERR        79A  O 24  1
     A  20                                  DSPATR(HI)
